flowchart TD
    RawPipeline["流水线高维原始状态流 (High-Dimensional Physical Substrate State)"] --> AccordionProjector["手风琴多分辨率投影器 (Accordion Multiresolution Projector)"]

    subgraph ResolutionLevels["手风琴四级认知分辨率 (The 4 Resolution Tiers)"]
